== Yellow Sash of Order ==

: You say, 'What yellow Sash of Order?'

: Velan Torresk says, 'The Sashes of Order are given out by the various trainers of our clan.  I give out the [white training sash] and the [yellow Sash of Order]. and [Reyia] is in charge of the [orange and red sashes].'

: Velan Torresk says, 'To earn the yellow sash, you must prove yourself to be very skilled in the art of fighting. The lands to the west and south of Freeport are filled with dangerous beasts that often prey upon innocent travelers. Help protect our merchant caravans and traveling citizens, while at the same time practicing your defensive skills, and eliminating these deadly creatures from the surrounding landscape. Bring me a giant snake rattle, a Deathfist slashed belt, the chitin of a desert tarantula, and turn in your white training sash, and I shall reward your noble work with our yellow Sash of Order. Good luck, Soandso !'


Turn the following items in to [[Velan Torresk]] in [[West Freeport]]: 

*1 - [[Deathfist Slashed Belt]] - The Deathfist Orcs can drop these. Only Centurions and stronger orcs have a chance to give you a belt, not pawns. There are two Deathfist orc camps in east commons (along the north wall, on either side of the "Hidden Inn") where you can hunt or ask to buy one of these belts.
*1 - [[Giant Snake Rattle]] - These drop off the tougher snakes, darkweeds and above. Darkweed snakes in East Commons are the quickest way to go. Giant Rattlesnakes in North Ro are another option. Warning: snakes have powerful poison.
*1 - [[Desert Tarantula Chitin]] - Dune Tarantulas in North Ro are where you'll find these. Make sure you loot the right item - "cracked" chitins are not useful for the quest.
*1 - White Training Sash - From the prior Quest

